WEBVTT

00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:04.771
Start with Preview.

00:00:04.771 --> 00:00:08.918
Agents read each record before the call, and a new team or a

00:00:08.918 --> 00:00:10.992
high value list needs that.

00:00:10.992 --> 00:00:12.940
No call can be abandoned.

00:00:13.690 --> 00:00:18.931
Move to Progressive or Power when the list is steady and agents wait between calls.

00:00:18.931 --> 00:00:23.700
Turn on the abandonment cap, and the abandoned call message, before you do.

00:00:24.450 --> 00:00:28.848
Choose Predictive with one call per reserved agent when you want the brake.

00:00:28.848 --> 00:00:34.550
Choose Over-dial only when you have measured the answer rate, and your rules allow abandoned calls.

00:00:35.300 --> 00:00:41.010
Use one profile for each campaign when its abandonment rate must be measured on its own.

